WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.150
Safex

00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:10.786
Candy, Annie and the others
finally had a reunion.

00:00:10.936 --> 00:00:15.594
Soon after that, she returned
to St. Joanna Hospital.

00:00:27.677 --> 00:00:33.115
Terry's melody.

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:44.026
I will do my best
and work hard from tomorrow.

00:00:49.165 --> 00:00:52.057
I am back, Franny!
What happened?

00:00:52.869 --> 00:00:56.006
A bus crushed into some cars.
Many people were injured.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.233
I'll change my clothes right now!

00:01:08.752 --> 00:01:10.412
Sorry I am late!

00:01:10.562 --> 00:01:12.614
Franny, where are the patients?

00:01:12.764 --> 00:01:17.130
In surgery. Practice nurses
are not needed for the moment.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.618
Franny...

00:01:38.915 --> 00:01:40.108
Excuse me...

00:01:40.258 --> 00:01:42.844
May I talk to you for a minute,
Franny?

00:01:42.994 --> 00:01:44.709
What do you want to say to me?

00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:49.017
Didn't you take a vacation?

00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:53.825
The nurses can take a vacation,
but the patients cannot afford it.

00:01:54.064 --> 00:01:58.794
Only you went out during the break.

00:01:58.944 --> 00:02:00.395
Only me?

00:02:00.545 --> 00:02:04.464
Right. Natalie and Judy
were in the hospital standing by.

00:02:06.643 --> 00:02:09.520
Only I went out.

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:11.072
What can I say?

00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:14.048
You are a princess from the Adleys.

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.746
It's not true!
I am not related to the Adleys!

00:02:17.896 --> 00:02:19.843
I am just a practice nurse.

00:02:20.493 --> 00:02:23.151
Are you?
Please quit playing around.

00:02:23.301 --> 00:02:27.862
The most important thing is
to get used to the new environment.

00:02:28.865 --> 00:02:31.493
Yes, you are right.

00:02:31.643 --> 00:02:34.529
I will do my best
and work harder from tomorrow.

00:02:34.679 --> 00:02:39.140
Don't bother my study if you don't have
anything important to say.

00:02:39.309 --> 00:02:40.867
I am sorry.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.879
The hospital is full of patients
because of the accident from last night.

00:02:51.029 --> 00:02:52.814
The practice nurses from Joseph Hospital,
who were still on vacation,

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:54.816
did a great job.

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:56.885
They were great!

00:02:57.035 --> 00:03:00.388
The head of our hospital
is very satisfied.

00:03:00.938 --> 00:03:04.192
I hope you won't forget
the spirit last night,

00:03:04.342 --> 00:03:09.034
and become outstanding nurses
very soon.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:15.609
From now on, you will take turns
on the night shift.

00:03:16.079 --> 00:03:18.809
- Tonight is Franny.
- Yes.

00:03:19.649 --> 00:03:22.447
- Tomorrow is Natalie.
- Yes.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.486
The day after tomorrow is Candice.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.223
Yes!

00:03:30.193 --> 00:03:32.491
This is not an elementary school.

00:03:32.762 --> 00:03:34.127
Sorry...

00:03:42.072 --> 00:03:43.664
Stear?

00:03:43.907 --> 00:03:45.568
Aren't you Stear?

00:03:45.776 --> 00:03:48.744
What happened to your hand?

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.308
I just want to look around
in the hospital.

00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:55.709
But I was afraid I might be recognized.
That's why I faked it.

00:03:55.859 --> 00:03:57.480
Then, your hand...

00:03:58.088 --> 00:04:00.079
It's OK.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.587
Can you come for a second?

00:04:05.395 --> 00:04:06.623
Annie!

00:04:06.997 --> 00:04:08.487
Candy!

00:04:11.468 --> 00:04:13.459
Annie, what is it?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.331
I bring good news!

00:04:19.976 --> 00:04:21.637
Terry is coming to Chicago!

00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:24.343
Terry?

00:04:26.516 --> 00:04:30.045
Terry's troupe
is going to perform here.

00:04:30.195 --> 00:04:31.815
Terry?

00:04:33.223 --> 00:04:34.622
Terry is coming!

00:04:34.924 --> 00:04:39.156
Terry's troupe
is really coming to Chicago.

00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:47.159
I just couldn't wait to tell you.

00:04:47.337 --> 00:04:49.006
Thanks, Annie!

00:04:49.839 --> 00:04:53.335
I didn't think
Terry would become an actor.

00:04:53.485 --> 00:04:55.803
I wonder what role he is playing?

00:04:55.953 --> 00:04:58.006
I will go find out.

00:04:59.015 --> 00:05:00.482
Please!

00:05:05.522 --> 00:05:08.355
I shouldn't be so uneasy.

00:05:10.527 --> 00:05:11.994
Terry,

00:05:12.262 --> 00:05:15.288
I want to go see you act!

00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:19.865
Terry, I miss you so much!

00:05:26.276 --> 00:05:30.975
I am going to beg the head nurse
tomorrow to let me go.

00:05:36.686 --> 00:05:38.916
- You want to switch your shift?
- Yes.

00:05:41.357 --> 00:05:45.353
I have seen a lot of practice nurses.

00:05:45.503 --> 00:05:49.660
You are the first one
who asked for a shift change.

00:05:49.866 --> 00:05:52.164
I have a friend whom I must see.

00:05:52.469 --> 00:05:57.429
I have to treat every nurse fairly.

00:05:58.274 --> 00:06:02.003
Candice, if I say "yes" to your request,

00:06:02.153 --> 00:06:04.747
how do I face the others?

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:08.410
It's just for one time only!

00:06:08.718 --> 00:06:09.844
Candice,

00:06:09.994 --> 00:06:14.322
The shift sheet is not arranged
by alphabet.

00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:18.708
I arranged it
according to your personalities.

00:06:21.231 --> 00:06:23.791
It's not changeable.

00:06:31.574 --> 00:06:34.302
Even if I can't go to the performance,

00:06:34.452 --> 00:06:38.507
I have to let Terry know
that I am in this hospital.

00:06:39.916 --> 00:06:41.144
Terry!

00:07:14.551 --> 00:07:15.610
This is...

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.246
What's wrong, Terry?

00:07:29.332 --> 00:07:30.859
This station...

00:07:31.009 --> 00:07:33.903
This station leads to Candy's home.

00:07:35.738 --> 00:07:37.165
On that day...

00:07:37.315 --> 00:07:40.702
I went to Pony's Home,
the one that Candy spoke about.

00:07:40.852 --> 00:07:42.745
There was a terrible snow storm.

00:08:05.335 --> 00:08:07.997
Candy, where are you?

00:08:16.079 --> 00:08:18.547
Annie, sorry for the wait.

00:08:18.848 --> 00:08:20.543
There's no problem now, Annie.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.076
Really?

00:08:22.585 --> 00:08:26.413
I am sure
the Adleys have ten invitations!

00:08:27.323 --> 00:08:29.849
Candy is included too?

00:08:31.094 --> 00:08:32.356
Of course.

00:08:32.795 --> 00:08:34.122
Great!

00:08:34.272 --> 00:08:35.824
Candy must be happy.

00:08:37.767 --> 00:08:40.167
So this is why...

00:08:42.705 --> 00:08:46.232
There was a serious accident
a couple days ago.

00:08:46.576 --> 00:08:52.207
To save the patients.
we can't waste even a second.

00:08:52.357 --> 00:08:54.542
Especially if they bleed heavily...

00:08:54.692 --> 00:08:56.011
Tonight...

00:08:56.461 --> 00:09:00.254
After tonight, when will I be able
to see Terry again?

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:02.984
Candice, pay attention!

00:09:03.134 --> 00:09:05.326
I am sorry.

00:09:12.602 --> 00:09:14.362
Turn up the lights!

00:09:14.992 --> 00:09:16.998
What? No way!

00:09:17.148 --> 00:09:18.737
Come on, let's rehearse again.

00:09:22.145 --> 00:09:25.345
There is a rehearsal on progress.
No visitors are allowed!

00:09:26.349 --> 00:09:28.243
Excuse me, I am looking for Terry.

00:09:28.493 --> 00:09:29.944
Terry?

00:09:30.094 --> 00:09:32.415
I am a fan of Terrius G. Grandchester.

00:09:33.489 --> 00:09:37.219
I wish I could see Terry, too.

00:09:37.569 --> 00:09:39.754
Is Terry...

00:09:40.004 --> 00:09:41.789
He doesn't respect his job.

00:09:41.939 --> 00:09:44.793
This swollen-headed guy
didn't come to the rehearsal.

00:09:45.003 --> 00:09:48.460
Terry is not here.
He must have gone to look for Candy.

00:09:49.706 --> 00:09:52.402
Won't you leave the flowers to us?

00:09:54.977 --> 00:09:58.277
I can't believe
Terry has this kind of friends.

00:10:05.388 --> 00:10:06.846
Terry?

00:10:21.671 --> 00:10:24.731
Knock before you come in, Miss Nurse.

00:10:26.109 --> 00:10:30.045
I am sorry, but the harmonica sound...

00:10:30.413 --> 00:10:32.643
You heard it?

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.279
Did you play it?

00:10:35.452 --> 00:10:39.114
Last time I played it,
a nurse with glasses stopped me.

00:10:39.564 --> 00:10:41.081
It must have been Franny.

00:10:41.958 --> 00:10:42.850
Candy!

00:10:43.059 --> 00:10:44.352
Franny!

00:10:44.502 --> 00:10:49.126
How can you put the medicine
in the wrong place?

00:10:49.465 --> 00:10:50.659
I am sorry.

00:10:51.367 --> 00:10:54.295
You need to be more responsible.

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:55.564
I will pay more attention.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.902
What can I do
to let Terry know that I am here?

00:11:09.419 --> 00:11:10.784
Wait.

00:11:10.953 --> 00:11:12.487
Are you a practice nurse?

00:11:14.157 --> 00:11:15.350
Yes.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.985
You must know Candy White then.

00:11:18.135 --> 00:11:19.520
We were in the same class.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.823
Anybody came to look for her?

00:11:21.973 --> 00:11:23.758
No visits are allowed on duty.

00:11:23.908 --> 00:11:26.828
Candy's shift ends tomorrow morning.

00:11:27.078 --> 00:11:28.696
Tomorrow morning?

00:11:28.846 --> 00:11:31.637
Did she ask people
to switch shifts with her?

00:11:34.844 --> 00:11:38.573
If she asks you,
don't switch it with her.

00:11:38.723 --> 00:11:40.115
I won't.

00:11:40.917 --> 00:11:43.351
This is for you.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.647
I can't take it...

00:11:45.997 --> 00:11:47.849
Please tell everyone.

00:11:47.999 --> 00:11:49.289
Stop!

00:11:56.399 --> 00:11:58.793
It seems like
he didn't come to the hospital.

00:11:58.943 --> 00:12:01.164
Where are you, Terry?

00:12:14.083 --> 00:12:15.910
Terry, you are here!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.850
Everyone is looking for you!

00:12:18.054 --> 00:12:20.515
I don't want to go
to the performance tonight.

00:12:20.665 --> 00:12:22.080
Terry...

00:12:23.726 --> 00:12:26.254
The audience will be full
of rich people.

00:12:26.404 --> 00:12:28.757
We have no right
to pick our audience.

00:12:29.307 --> 00:12:30.258
Is that so?

00:12:30.408 --> 00:12:33.828
I don't want to serve the celebrities.

00:12:34.478 --> 00:12:38.232
But, this is a charity show.

00:12:38.382 --> 00:12:40.707
A charity show? Sorry.

00:12:41.344 --> 00:12:43.571
Terry, let's go back.

00:12:43.721 --> 00:12:48.206
Susanna, will the poor
really be helped by this?

00:12:49.585 --> 00:12:51.546
This...

00:12:51.696 --> 00:12:53.648
A real charity show

00:12:53.798 --> 00:12:57.619
should be held for those
who can't afford the tickets.

00:12:58.794 --> 00:13:00.462
That's true.

00:13:03.299 --> 00:13:04.526
That harmonica...

00:13:05.276 --> 00:13:06.794
The harmonica?

00:13:06.944 --> 00:13:12.000
Every time something bothers you,
you play it.

00:13:22.818 --> 00:13:26.049
From now on, let's replace
the cigarette by the harmonica.

00:13:27.957 --> 00:13:30.421
It must be very important to you.

00:13:32.161 --> 00:13:34.026
It keeps me from smoking.

00:13:56.919 --> 00:13:59.217
The show starts in thirty minutes.

00:13:59.555 --> 00:14:03.321
After tonight, when will be
the next time I see Terry?

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:10.328
I wish I could fly there.

00:14:22.912 --> 00:14:24.243
That child...

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.480
What's wrong?

00:14:33.389 --> 00:14:35.516
It hurts so much!

00:14:35.666 --> 00:14:38.119
Nobody came to see me,
so I started playing the harmonica...

00:14:38.269 --> 00:14:40.221
I'll go find the doctor.

00:14:40.371 --> 00:14:41.595
Thanks.

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:49.730
I can't leave the patient
to see Terry.

00:14:58.681 --> 00:15:01.047
Natalie, didn't you...

00:15:02.218 --> 00:15:04.245
Didn't you get off work?

00:15:04.395 --> 00:15:05.912
I want to know the reason.

00:15:06.422 --> 00:15:07.315
The reason?

00:15:07.565 --> 00:15:11.654
Who do you want to see?
Why did you want to switch shifts?

00:15:13.229 --> 00:15:15.663
Forget it, I already gave up.

00:15:17.466 --> 00:15:20.229
Is it about a boy?

00:15:21.871 --> 00:15:25.608
You wanted to switch the shift
with me for a date?

00:15:27.376 --> 00:15:29.606
We live far away.

00:15:30.513 --> 00:15:32.879
We don't know
when will we meet again.

00:15:34.116 --> 00:15:35.543
So...

00:15:35.693 --> 00:15:37.813
You are a cry-baby.

00:15:38.387 --> 00:15:40.581
Stop it!

00:15:40.731 --> 00:15:42.850
That boy likes you?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.984
Drop it, Natalie!

00:15:46.462 --> 00:15:48.589
I'll switch it with you.

00:15:49.732 --> 00:15:51.563
Natalie!

00:15:52.001 --> 00:15:55.459
Franny is in the library, it's ok.

00:15:56.405 --> 00:15:58.532
Are you sure, Natalie?

00:15:59.008 --> 00:16:03.738
I was always afraid to get into trouble
since I was a child.

00:16:03.888 --> 00:16:05.906
And now I am Franny's follower.

00:16:06.182 --> 00:16:08.042
Then why would you...

00:16:08.192 --> 00:16:09.942
Franny won't blame me.

00:16:10.092 --> 00:16:11.379
Natalie!

00:16:11.529 --> 00:16:14.149
Honestly, I don't really like you.

00:16:17.326 --> 00:16:20.693
But, I met someone today
who I dislike more.

00:16:21.197 --> 00:16:24.094
Who tries to win people's hearts
with money.

00:16:25.601 --> 00:16:26.728
Was it...

00:16:26.978 --> 00:16:28.896
Give her back the money!

00:16:29.046 --> 00:16:32.634
She is about the same age with us.
You know who she is, right?

00:16:33.576 --> 00:16:35.203
Eliza?

00:16:36.245 --> 00:16:38.611
Go change your clothes.

00:16:39.448 --> 00:16:41.507
Thank you, Natalie!

00:16:41.784 --> 00:16:43.718
Don't let Franny find out
about this.

00:16:55.164 --> 00:16:56.590
Candy is so slow.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.793
The show starts in five minutes.

00:16:58.943 --> 00:17:00.699
Annie, she is not here yet?

00:17:02.638 --> 00:17:03.828
Not yet.

00:17:10.146 --> 00:17:12.910
Please hurry!

00:17:17.319 --> 00:17:19.854
I am going to see Terry soon.

00:17:20.089 --> 00:17:22.917
Terry, I am coming!

00:17:23.067 --> 00:17:25.961
We will be able to see each other
in five minutes.

00:17:29.198 --> 00:17:32.998
Candy's heart is full of joy.

00:17:33.602 --> 00:17:35.231
The rapid sound of the carriage

00:17:35.471 --> 00:17:38.734
along with Candy's expectation
and unease,

00:17:39.075 --> 00:17:42.638
is echoing in the street.
